{"asset_key":"mn/herohub_story_10415766","episode":"mn","category":"herohub_story","story_id":"10415766","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:1:1041576601:1":{"text":"いい、ピッパー。あとで守備軍が探しに来ても、私を見てないって言うのよ！","source_cn":"听着，皮帕，如果等会有守备军找了过来，你就说你没看见我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3CB575621DD9775D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:2:1041576602:1":{"text":"でも……嘘をつくのはよくないですし、ボク、緊張するとすぐどもっちゃうから、きっとばれちゃいますよ！","source_cn":"可是……撒谎是不对的，而且我只要一紧张，说话就会结结巴...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x92CE9D834A0F9CD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1041576603:1":{"text":"そ、そうだ、魔法でボクたちを隠しましょうか？前に壁を出そうとしたら、踊るキノコの群れが出てきちゃいましたけど……","source_cn":"要不……我用魔法把我们藏起来？虽然我上次想变一堵墙，结...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x49D65279EF718ACF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1041576604:1":{"text":"踊るキノコ？ちょうどいいじゃない！守備軍が怖がって逃げていくかもしれないわ！","source_cn":"会跳舞的蘑菇？这不正好吗！说不定能把守备军吓跑呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xAF0419DEE0F8D47E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1041576605:1":{"text":"あなたの魔法って本当に面白いのね。踊るキノコなんて、私には思いつけないもの。","source_cn":"你的魔法真有意思，我怎么没想到能把我们变成蘑菇呢！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECFF2D8A25523325","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1041576606:1":{"text":"えへへ。実はソリス先生も、ボクの混沌魔法は時々、不思議なひらめきをくれるって言ってました。","source_cn":"嘿嘿，其实娑丽丝老师也说，我的混沌魔法有时候能带来奇妙...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCE824C5F9EFFE208","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1041576607:1":{"text":"この前も、魔法で松ぼっくりを集めようとしたら、杖からものすごい火が吹き出したんです！","source_cn":"就像上次，我本来是想用魔法收集松果，结果魔杖里却蹿出了...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC800B21C07BC673E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1041576608:1":{"text":"でもラッキーなことに、松ぼっくりがちょうどよくこんがり焼けたんですよ。","source_cn":"幸运的是，那些松果被烤得刚刚好！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD67E8997385E994","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1041576609:1":{"text":"わあ、スリル満点ね！","source_cn":"哇，这听起来也太刺激了吧！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9C76F83A602C6B7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1041576610:1":{"text":"ピッパー、次に松ぼっくりを集める時は、絶対に私も連れていってね！","source_cn":"皮帕，下次你烤松果的时候一定要带上我！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2AE80624030473F9","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1041576611:1":{"text":"えっ？で、でも……危ないですよ。万が一ドレスに火がついたら……","source_cn":"诶？可是……可是很危险的，要是点燃了你的裙子怎么办？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x78B39EFFF38536D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1041576612:1":{"text":"その時は別のドレスに着替えればいいじゃない。別に大したことないわ！","source_cn":"那就换一条裙子嘛，这有什么大不了的！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20B4C7AEA5AF9820","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1041576613:1":{"text":"あなたの混沌魔法が起こす不思議な変化を実際に見られることの方が、ずっと面白そうだもの！","source_cn":"能亲眼看到你的混沌魔法的奇妙变化，才是最酷的体验好吗！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1AD27264FE813166","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:佩吉":{"text":"ペギー","source":"佩吉","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:皮帕":{"text":"ピッパー","source":"皮帕","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":14,"localized_text_count":13,"speaker_count":2}}